   "rotation": 0,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "THE ALBANIA FILES",
    "style": "headline"
   },
   "type": "text",
   "z": 1
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 126,
    "width": 720,
    "x": -460,
    "y": -2240
   },
   "id": "DE2F609B-9898-572A-85BB-43226FA70EC9",
   "locked": true,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": 0,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "**Jared Kushner · Ivanka Trump · Donald Trump**: Sazan Island and Zvërnec, the Flamingo Revolution, the question of Israel's role, and the billions behind Affinity Partners.\nCompiled 15 Oct 2026 from public reporting. Each card names its source.",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "type": "text",
   "z": 2
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 223,
    "width": 360,
    "x": 330,
    "y": -2340
   },
   "id": "DABD2BEE-9F71-5FEC-9D97-69C39B0B5BFD",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": 0.8,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "HOW TO READ THIS BOARD\n✅ reported by named outlets/records\n⚠️ disputed, denied or conflicting\n❌ traced: no evidence found\nred string ....... money, ownership\nazure ............ family, politics\nrose ............. the protests\ndashed ........... alleged / withdrawn\ndotted ........... debunked",
    "style": "typewriter"
   },
   "type": "text",
   "z": 3
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 146,
    "width": 300,
    "x": -330,
    "y": -1960
   },
   "id": "63AE535B-2A14-58EE-907C-8E1AE9C625F0",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": -0.8,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "**DONALD TRUMP**\n47th U.S. President (since 20 Jan 2025). Father-in-law of Jared Kushner. Created the Gaza **Board of Peace** in Jan 2026.",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "tint": "amber",
   "type": "text",
   "z": 4
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 185,
    "width": 300,
    "x": -330,
    "y": -1640
   },
   "id": "BEF417B5-E965-527D-8118-88C3378B0D0A",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": 0.7,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "**JARED KUSHNER**\nFounder and CEO of **Affinity Partners** (2021). Former senior White House adviser. 2026: U.S. *Special Envoy for Peace* and founding member of the Board of Peace's executive board.",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "tint": "red",
   "type": "text",
   "z": 5
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 204,
    "width": 300,
    "x": -760,
    "y": -1800
   },
   "id": "936C4F54-4DE1-5247-8178-9E063FF5B27C",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": 0.5,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "**IVANKA TRUMP**\nTrump's daughter, Kushner's wife. In Vlorë with Kushner on **21 Jan 2026**; dined with PM Rama (Greek press). Has toured the area with architects and investors (Al Jazeera). No formal role in the companies found.",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "tint": "rose",
   "type": "text",
   "z": 6
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 165,
    "width": 300,
    "x": -1190,
    "y": -1960
   },
   "id": "D9B3B494-4D73-54E5-B27C-B2AE9A8459AD",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": 1.1,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "**EDI RAMA**\nPrime Minister of Albania. Chairs the Strategic Investment Committee that approved Sazan. Defends the project; protesters want him out.",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "tint": "azure",
   "type": "text",
   "z": 7
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 165,
    "width": 300,
    "x": -1190,
    "y": -1610
   },
   "id": "28392B18-1CDA-5052-97F5-A03FF13516CC",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": -1.2,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "**ASHER ABEHSERA**\nKushner's long-time real-estate partner from New York. Chairman and CEO of **Sazan Real Estate Development (SRED)**, which leads the project (AFP, Reuters).",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "tint": "violet",
   "type": "text",
   "z": 8
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 185,
    "width": 300,
    "x": -1190,
    "y": -1290
   },
   "id": "18916E49-2E93-552C-8704-935E5A128A07",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": -0.2,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "**MOUTAZ & RAMEZ AL-KHAYYAT**\nQatar-based brothers of Syrian origin, co-founders of UCC Holding. Filings show them holding most of SRED (Exit News). Their **Albania Land Development** bought Zvërnec beachfront plots (OCCRP).",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "tint": "lime",
   "type": "text",
   "z": 9
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 126,
    "width": 300,
    "x": 560,
    "y": -1960
   },
   "id": "9FA8B464-170F-5EFF-A9AE-BB87D8FE5C30",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": -1.3,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "**MOHAMMED BIN SALMAN**\nSaudi Crown Prince. Chairs the **Public Investment Fund (PIF)**, Affinity's anchor investor.",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "tint": "teal",
   "type": "text",
   "z": 10
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 165,
    "width": 320,
    "x": 120,
    "y": -1640
   },
   "id": "A8203190-EC25-50DB-8CFF-498C7FAFFEAF",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": -0.8,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "**AFFINITY PARTNERS**\nKushner's Miami private-equity firm, funded mostly from the Gulf. Assets passed **$6 billion** in 2025 (Dealroom). Had returned no profit to investors by 2024.",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "tint": "graphite",
   "type": "text",
   "z": 11
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 78,
    "width": 620,
    "x": -3250,
    "y": -2000
   },
   "id": "9C9F4916-514C-5B1A-A745-B563BD819A92",
   "locked": true,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": 0,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "THE ISLAND AND THE LAGOON",
    "style": "headline"
   },
   "type": "text",
   "z": 12
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 631,
    "width": 460,
    "x": -3250,
    "y": -1880
   },
   "id": "B28825AA-DDC4-5C09-9F0C-7902776013C4",
   "image": {
    "asset": "sha256-42d2c6406bf5652ffd1d5da0cb3091d0e80980137e7c49097b36054048ea96a3",
    "caption": "Vlora Bay: Sazan, Zvërnec, Narta Lagoon (schematic)",
    "frameStyle": "polaroid"
   },
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": -1.0,
   "type": "image",
   "z": 13
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 165,
    "width": 310,
    "x": -2730,
    "y": -1880
   },
   "id": "ACA32FD2-E527-51CE-BBE7-8B0FFC502E5F",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": -0.8,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "✅ **22 Feb 2024: Law 21/2024**\nParliament rewrites the Protected Areas law so **five-star resorts** can be built inside protected areas. Conservation groups say it gutted Vjosa–Narta's safeguards.",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "type": "text",
   "z": 14
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 204,
    "width": 310,
    "x": -2730,
    "y": -1669
   },
   "id": "CC8C4A69-D9D2-5BE7-9D89-39BCCF7DE0C3",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": 0.4,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "✅ **30 Dec 2024: Sazan approved**\nRama's Strategic Investment Committee gives *strategic investor* status to **Atlantic Incubation Partners**, linked to Affinity: 45 ha, **€1.4 billion**, about 1,000 jobs. About three weeks before Trump's inauguration (Reuters).",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "type": "text",
   "z": 15
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 204,
    "width": 310,
    "x": -2730,
    "y": -1419
   },
   "id": "C1BC49B3-AD75-58A9-8DD0-5840ECEE1A75",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": 0.1,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "✅ **Zvërnec: €230 million**\nKushner says his partnership bought the land from a private party for €230M and that the whole project could reach **about €4 billion**. Calls himself a minority partner, with Abehsera running it (Citizens.al, 9 Oct 2026).",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "type": "text",
   "z": 16
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 153,
    "width": 310,
    "x": -2730,
    "y": -1169
   },
   "id": "629FE6D1-F8E5-5904-B36E-FA379377A6BB",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": -0.8,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "KUSHNER'S ACCOUNT\n(Oct 2026, paraphrased)\n- land bought privately, €230M\n- titles checked by lawyers\n- nothing given by the state\n- up to ~€4B, jobs, growth",
    "style": "typewriter"
   },
   "type": "text",
   "z": 17
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 224,
    "width": 320,
    "x": -2370,
    "y": -1880
   },
   "id": "0C3EF10F-9CB8-5A74-B5DF-A34410A6A012",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": 0.2,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "⚠️ **Who is the developer?**\nAffinity says it is *not* the developer: investors joined \"in their personal capacity\". Lead company **SRED** was registered in Qatar in Oct 2025 (AFP). Most of it is held by the Al-Khayyat brothers; co-owners in Luxembourg and Delaware have undisclosed owners (Exit News).",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "type": "text",
   "z": 18
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 263,
    "width": 320,
    "x": -2370,
    "y": -1610
   },
   "id": "DA38D96D-F353-535E-A26C-7F59FC1674EB",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": 0.9,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "⚠️ **SPAK investigation**\nAlbania's anti-corruption prosecutor is probing the 2024 protected-status changes, the land titles and the money used to buy them. Reuters saw files suspecting a **Miami-based Albanian businessman**, wanted for laundering drug money, of forging ownership papers. The files allege **no wrongdoing** by Kushner, SRED or other investors.",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "type": "text",
   "z": 19
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 204,
    "width": 320,
    "x": -2370,
    "y": -1301
   },
   "id": "FD55A935-2646-5568-80DC-DEDAC84950C9",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": -1.4,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "⚠️ **Frozen, then unfrozen?**\nReported: SPAK froze about **$195M** in Albania Land Development accounts, then lifted it within days. SPAK has confirmed neither. In July it told U.S. media it had *no open investigation*, which conflicts with the land-title probe.",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "type": "text",
   "z": 20
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
