   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "THE FLAMINGO REVOLUTION",
    "style": "headline"
   },
   "type": "text",
   "z": 26
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 146,
    "width": 300,
    "x": -3250,
    "y": 0
   },
   "id": "ED89C74B-9306-52EE-8CF8-E351DB782B40",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": -1.1,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "✅ **23 May 2026**\nResidents find barbed wire fencing off Pishë Poro beach in the Vjosa–Narta protected landscape, and tear it down.",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "tint": "rose",
   "type": "text",
   "z": 27
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 185,
    "width": 300,
    "x": -3250,
    "y": 192
   },
   "id": "7013CDBB-484F-5B54-857C-46025097C43D",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": -1.1,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "✅ **30 May 2026: Zvërnec**\nPrivate guards drag away a man protesting the fence at the site. A **Major Security** guard is arrested and charged with unlawful deprivation of liberty and minor injury.",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "tint": "rose",
   "type": "text",
   "z": 28
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 171,
    "width": 300,
    "x": -3250,
    "y": 423
   },
   "id": "FE63CFB4-1C80-5C4A-BC27-BC4058192CC5",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": 1.0,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "\"Private property security guards have no right whatsoever to use force against anyone.\"\n— Albania's Interior Minister, demanding punishment and a review of the firm's licence",
    "style": "typewriter"
   },
   "type": "text",
   "z": 29
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 165,
    "width": 300,
    "x": -2900,
    "y": 0
   },
   "id": "00201136-C67E-581A-AD26-58B9D02C6A84",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": 0.3,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "✅ **31 May 2026: Tirana**\nThousands march; clashes with police. A pink flamingo becomes the symbol. Protests spread to other cities, Kosovo and the diaspora.",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "tint": "rose",
   "type": "text",
   "z": 30
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 206,
    "width": 300,
    "x": -2900,
    "y": 211
   },
   "id": "3FCC06B7-BB89-579A-981A-416A78194295",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": 0.9,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "THE DEMANDS\n1. Cancel the resort concession\n2. Independent SPAK probe of the contract\n3. Permanent protection for the wetlands\n4. Resignations, up to Rama's government",
    "style": "typewriter"
   },
   "type": "text",
   "z": 31
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 146,
    "width": 300,
    "x": -2900,
    "y": 463
   },
   "id": "438F0ABC-26BB-5D4A-93D4-AE865DE2A478",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": 0.6,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "✅ **June 2026: Brussels**\nThe European Parliament urges Albania to repeal the 2024 amendments and stop construction in protected areas (Citizens.al).",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "tint": "rose",
   "type": "text",
   "z": 32
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 185,
    "width": 300,
    "x": -2550,
    "y": 0
   },
   "id": "530A7375-F04C-5A54-B61B-48FF86BD1DA7",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": 0.1,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "✅ **100+ days on**\nStill going. 15 protesters face criminal proceedings; 2 security employees are under investigation. **13 Oct 2026**: students clash with police outside the Education Ministry.",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "tint": "rose",
   "type": "text",
   "z": 33
  },
