   "z": 36
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 78,
    "width": 760,
    "x": -1600,
    "y": -560
   },
   "id": "1A663D80-E97D-504E-AA90-CF83EE5BC98E",
   "locked": true,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": 0,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "ISRAEL'S ROLE? TRACED",
    "style": "headline"
   },
   "type": "text",
   "z": 37
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 136,
    "width": 340,
    "x": -1600,
    "y": -460
   },
   "id": "A18B2DC2-C806-50A3-94C1-D9104E9C765D",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": -0.6,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "THE QUESTION\nDid Israel play a role in the Flamingo protests or the resort?\nMethod: follow each claim back to its source.",
    "style": "typewriter"
   },
   "type": "text",
   "z": 38
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 165,
    "width": 330,
    "x": -1600,
    "y": -200
   },
   "id": "53757100-4224-5E47-A2D0-59D91F9021F8",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": 1.0,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "❌ **\"Selling the coast to Jewish billionaires and the Israeli military\"**\nAI-generated posts and fake headlines on Facebook, TikTok, Instagram and YouTube (Times of Israel). Nothing behind them.",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "tint": "graphite",
   "type": "text",
   "z": 39
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 146,
    "width": 330,
    "x": -1600,
    "y": 11
   },
   "id": "E9BAE0FE-803F-53CA-98D8-AFE511BC9BEE",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": 0.2,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "❌ **Video of \"Israeli soldiers beating locals\"**\nWent viral in June 2026. Nothing shows the men are Israeli soldiers (Times of Israel).",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "tint": "graphite",
   "type": "text",
   "z": 40
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 126,
    "width": 330,
    "x": -1600,
    "y": 203
   },
   "id": "F664B547-5DA8-5F25-9A66-29727DF9F66B",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": 0.6,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "❌ **Photo: a fence with Israeli and Albanian flags as a \"new border\"**\nDigitally manipulated (fact-check, June 2026).",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "tint": "graphite",
   "type": "text",
   "z": 41
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 224,
    "width": 330,
    "x": -1230,
    "y": -200
   },
   "id": "9CF5CA65-EB60-5A84-A1B5-A1260E3663B1",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": -1.3,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "❌ **\"Israel or Israeli investors are behind the project\"**\nNo reporting supports it. Filings point to the Qatar-based Al-Khayyat brothers, Kushner and Abehsera. A leader of Albania's Jewish community: *\"This has nothing to do with the Albanian Jewish community or with Israeli investors.\"*",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "tint": "graphite",
   "type": "text",
   "z": 42
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 146,
    "width": 330,
    "x": -1230,
    "y": 70
   },
   "id": "D465315E-5E65-5266-9F97-8944440BA706",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": -0.8,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "❌ **Were the guards Israeli?**\nThe firm at Zvërnec was **Major Security**, an Albanian private security company. No reporting on foreign ownership.",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "tint": "graphite",
   "type": "text",
   "z": 43
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 165,
    "width": 330,
    "x": -1230,
    "y": 262
   },
   "id": "B3F6E61A-20D3-5DD7-9A32-7DB1C1AF28AB",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": -0.6,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "⚠️ **Who spreads it?**\nLocal observers blame Russia, Iran and Turkey for stirring unrest; others call the antisemitism a false flag to discredit the protests. Neither is proven.",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "tint": "graphite",
   "type": "text",
   "z": 44
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 204,
    "width": 340,
    "x": -860,
    "y": -200
   },
   "id": "BC2FF0C7-EE4D-5859-AD53-B6ACDF796382",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": -1.2,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "✅ **Documented: Albania and Israel**\nJune 2025 defence cooperation agreement. Nov 2025: **Elbit Systems** to supply howitzers, mortars and drones, then build drones in Albania with state firm KAYO. Oct 2026: energy and cyber pact. Reporting doesn't tie any of it to the resort.",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "tint": "teal",
   "type": "text",
   "z": 45
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 204,
    "width": 340,
    "x": -860,
    "y": 50
   },
   "id": "5010CB4F-148B-5880-BB90-56F5FA84E765",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": -0.7,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "✅ **Documented: Kushner and Israeli money**\nAffinity is the largest shareholder of **Phoenix Financial**. Phoenix holds about $456–465M in nine defence-linked firms, Elbit the largest (CNN, 1 Oct 2026). Kushner: \"deeply misleading\"; Affinity doesn't own those firms.",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "tint": "teal",
   "type": "text",
   "z": 46
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 146,
    "width": 340,
    "x": -860,
    "y": 300
   },
   "id": "5F583333-F5DF-5D92-9C8D-5C429F0829F8",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": -1.1,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "⚠️ **Jan 2025 rumour: Albania to take 100,000 Gazans**\nFrom an Israeli journalist's post. Rama: *\"I haven't heard something so false in a long time.\"*",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "tint": "teal",
   "type": "text",
   "z": 47
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 206,
    "width": 420,
    "x": -1600,
    "y": 780
   },
   "id": "5509DC2B-FC59-5472-9D02-32B3DF823C57",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": 0.4,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "VERDICT, 15 OCT 2026\nNo credible reporting shows Israel (its government, military or Israeli investors) organising, funding or policing the protests, or owning the resort. Inside the protests, the 'Israeli role' lives in fakes.\nThe real threads run elsewhere: Elbit arms for Albania, and Kushner's Phoenix stake. They meet at Elbit, not at Zvërnec.",
    "style": "typewriter"
   },
   "type": "text",
   "z": 48
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 236,
    "width": 340,
    "x": -1130,
    "y": 700
   },
   "id": "4E701931-AC0D-59D6-8C20-6889FB275E52",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": 0.4,
   "type": "web",
   "web": {
    "snapshot": {
     "description": "Antisemitic fakes on the fringes of the Albanian protests.",
     "fetchedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
