     "title": "Israel and Albania Strengthen Ties as Elbit to Provide It With Artillery, Mortars and Drones",
     "variant": "compact"
    },
    "url": "https://www.haaretz.com/israel-news/security-aviation/2025-11-12/ty-article/.premium/israel-albania-strengthen-ties-as-elbit-to-provide-it-with-artillery-mortars-and-drones/0000019a-78d7-d326-a3ff-fcdf3d180000"
   },
   "z": 50
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 78,
    "width": 600,
    "x": 520,
    "y": -1500
   },
   "id": "00FEBE9C-E177-5092-A353-90013E97F99B",
   "locked": true,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": 0,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "THE BILLIONS",
    "style": "headline"
   },
   "type": "text",
   "z": 51
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 185,
    "width": 320,
    "x": 520,
    "y": -1390
   },
   "id": "8DB6A00E-04CB-5223-928D-6ED61806E964",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": -0.8,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "✅ **$2 billion: Saudi PIF (2021)**\nPIF's own advisory panel objected: inexperienced team, \"excessive\" fees, PR risk (minutes, 30 Jun 2021). The board, chaired by MBS, overruled it days later (NYT, Apr 2022).",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "tint": "teal",
   "type": "text",
   "z": 52
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 146,
    "width": 320,
    "x": 520,
    "y": -1159
   },
   "id": "9E2433F1-1A3C-5CCE-9A5F-84EB5691DAE1",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": -0.7,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "✅ **Qatar and Abu Dhabi**\nQatar's QIA and Abu Dhabi's Lunate: **$539M** combined by March 2022. Later reporting: UAE- and Qatar-linked firms, at least **$1.5B**.",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "tint": "teal",
   "type": "text",
   "z": 53
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 185,
    "width": 320,
    "x": 520,
    "y": -967
   },
   "id": "DDF7349F-97EB-5368-A79C-05A7378E48FF",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": 1.2,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "⚠️ **Fees and fresh money**\nReported: about **$157M** in fees from foreign investors (about $87M Saudi), and a push to raise about $5B more in the Gulf while serving as envoy. Figures vary by source and date.",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "tint": "teal",
   "type": "text",
   "z": 54
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 185,
    "width": 320,
    "x": 880,
    "y": -1390
   },
   "id": "02811C1B-224F-5CE9-8B53-7877DFD40718",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": 0.4,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "✅ **$55 billion: Electronic Arts**\nTaken private by **PIF, Silver Lake and Affinity**. Announced 29 Sep 2025, closed **4 Aug 2026**: $210 a share, $20B of JPMorgan debt. Called the largest all-cash sponsor take-private ever.",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "tint": "red",
   "type": "text",
   "z": 55
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 185,
    "width": 320,
    "x": 880,
    "y": -1159
   },
   "id": "BF6EF423-381E-5035-A3AB-7D5D8791B6E9",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": 0.3,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "✅ **About $1.06 billion: Phoenix Financial (Israel)**\nBought 4.95% for $128.5M (Jul 2024); nearly 10% approved Jan 2025, just before the inauguration; sold about 2.5% for about $343M (Jul 2026). Keeps **7.4%**.",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "tint": "red",
   "type": "text",
   "z": 56
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 185,
    "width": 320,
    "x": 880,
    "y": -928
   },
   "id": "736335ED-5FFD-5DB8-9F20-272EBE996BB1",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": -0.9,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "⚠️ **$108.4B: Paramount's bid for Warner Bros. Discovery**\nAffinity joined in Oct 2025 with about $200M of equity, then **withdrew on 16 Dec 2025**. Trump had said he would personally review the deal.",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "tint": "red",
   "type": "text",
   "z": 57
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 185,
    "width": 320,
    "x": 1240,
    "y": -1390
   },
   "id": "E1E90836-B11A-5F8E-8EA4-C1DCA18378AC",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": 0.6,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "⚠️ **About $500M: Belgrade, Serbia**\nA Trump-branded hotel on the bombed Army headquarters. Affinity **withdrew on 15 Dec 2025**, hours after Culture Minister Nikola Selaković was indicted over lifting the site's heritage protection.",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "tint": "red",
   "type": "text",
   "z": 58
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 204,
    "width": 320,
    "x": 1240,
    "y": -1159
   },
   "id": "8657BE0C-A54A-56ED-885A-661FF50D2955",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": -0.9,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "⚠️ **Gaza: the Board of Peace**\nKushner sits on its founding executive board (Jan 2026). Rep. Raskin's letter (16 Apr 2026): envoy role plus Gulf investors means conflicts of interest. Senators question a Gaza stablecoin plan (17 Apr 2026).",
    "style": "note"
   },
   "tint": "amber",
   "type": "text",
   "z": 59
  },
  {
   "createdAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "frame": {
    "height": 136,
    "width": 320,
    "x": 1240,
    "y": -909
   },
   "id": "38C38842-D3FD-5FD1-AAFE-92D068CBC2E8",
   "locked": false,
   "modifiedAt": "2026-10-15T15:00:00Z",
   "rotation": -0.3,
   "text": {
    "alignment": "leading",
    "autoHeight": true,
    "content": "\"What people call conflicts of interest, Steve and I call experience.\"\n— Jared Kushner, 2025, on himself and envoy Steve Witkoff",
    "style": "typewriter"
   },
   "type": "text",
   "z": 60
